{"category_edits":[{"category":"learning_objective","rationale":"Add a 0.1-weighted margin ranking loss using the existing sampled negatives for all four category models. This encourages positive-negative separation while preserving the GRU architecture, sampling, optimizer, schedule, and inference.","edits":[{"find":"    pairwise_loss = torch.nn.functional.softplus(valid_neg - valid_pos)
    return (weights * pairwise_loss).sum()","replace":"    pairwise_loss = torch.nn.functional.softplus(valid_neg - valid_pos)
    margin_loss = torch.nn.functional.softplus(0.5 + valid_neg - valid_pos).mean()
    return (weights * pairwise_loss).sum() + 0.1 * margin_loss"}]}],"change_summary":"Augment the existing loss with the specified margin objective. Each category retains one independently trained GRU model; predictor changes are unnecessary."}
